#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t00"
msgid "花子　：いらっしゃーい！　花子ちゃーん！"
msgstr "Hanako: Welcooome! It's little Hanako!"

#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t01"
msgid "花子　：そこらの学校で、コックリさんとか　　　　やる人がいるけど、本当はやめた方　　　　がいいんだよー！"
msgstr "Hanako: People at schools everywhere play Kokkuri-san, but really, you'd better not!"

#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t02"
msgid "花子　：ここだけの話、マジで”来る”よ。　　　　まぁ、低級な浮遊霊が見に来たり　　　　　する程度だけどさー。"
msgstr "Hanako: Just between us, something seriously does \"come\". Well, it's only low-grade wandering spirits coming for a look, but still."

#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t03"
msgid "花子　：実はね、本格的なコックリさんの　　　　　方法があってね・・・。"
msgstr "Hanako: Actually, there's a proper, full-on way to do Kokkuri-san..."

#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t04"
msgid "花子　：・・・"
msgstr "Hanako: ..."

#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t05"
msgid "花子　：・・・くさ・・・"
msgstr "Hanako: ...Kusa..."

#. event 5, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e005/p1/t06"
msgid "花子　：やーめた！　ここで書くと本当に　　　　　やって何か召喚するおバカさんが　　　　　でるからねー！　危ない危ない！"
msgstr "Hanako: Never mind! If I wrote it here, some dummy would really do it and summon something! Too dangerous!"

