#. event 9, page 0 | screen 566, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e009/p0/t00"
msgid "花子　：べべんべーん！　花子ショー！"
msgstr "Hanako: Ta-ta-daaa! The Hanako Show!"

#. event 9, page 0 | screen 566, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e009/p0/t01"
msgid "花子　：女子トイレの花子さんは超有名な　　　　　話だけど、奥から３番目のトイレ　　　　　が一番、危ないんだって！"
msgstr "Hanako: Hanako-san of the girls' toilet is a super famous story, but they say the third stall from the back is the most dangerous one!"

#. event 9, page 0 | screen 566, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e009/p0/t02"
msgid "花子　：窓ぎわも危ないんだけど・・・。　　　　　まぁ、そういうこと！"
msgstr "Hanako: By the window is dangerous too... Well, that's how it is!"

#. event 10, page 0 | screen 561, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e010/p0/t00"
msgid "花子　：真言や陀羅尼は、元々は”ボン語”　　　　なの！　インドの文章語だから、　　　　　アルファベットを音訳した形で日本　　　　に伝わったのだー！"
msgstr "Hanako: Mantras and dharani were originally in Sanskrit! Since it's the written language of India, they came to Japan in a form that copies the sounds!"

#. event 10, page 0 | screen 561, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e010/p0/t01"
msgid "花子　：伝えたのは、［空海］って人！　　　　　　名前ぐらいは、どこかで聞いたコト　　　　あるでしょ？　室町時代に伝わった　　　　らしいよ！"
msgstr "Hanako: The one who brought them was a man called [Kukai]! You've heard the name somewhere, right? They say they arrived in the Muromachi period!"

#. event 10, page 0 | screen 561, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT10/e010/p0/t02"
msgid "花子　：例えば、陀羅尼は dharani とか　　　　　　が音訳されたの！　ダラニでしょ？　　　　主に長い文を陀羅尼、真言は短い文　　　　とされて、区別されてるわけ！"
msgstr "Hanako: For example, \"darani\" was copied from the sound of \"dharani\"! See? Mainly the long texts are called dharani and the short ones mantras. That's the difference!"

